# Twitter Service

## Server
HTTP_PORT=8000
GRPC_PORT=50052

## MongoDB
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/ecoguard

## RabbitMQ
RABBITMQ_URI=amqp://guest:guest@localhost:5672

## gRPC peers
CLASSIFICATION_GRPC_ADDR=http://localhost:50053
NLP_GRPC_ADDR=http://localhost:50055
BLOCKCHAIN_GRPC_ADDR=http://localhost:50056
ASSET_GRPC_ADDR=http://localhost:50058

## Vault (for secrets storage — Twitter credentials, DB URIs)
VAULT_ADDR=http://localhost:8200
VAULT_TOKEN=dev-only-token
